msgid "**Output:**"
msgstr "**Sortida:**"

#: ../../modules/analog/analog_hamiltonian.rst:30
msgid ""
":meth:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.Hamiltonian.random` instead draws an "
"independent coefficient for each placement, uniformly at random from "
"``coefficient_range`` (``(-1.0, 1.0)`` by default):"
msgstr ""
":meth:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.Hamiltonian.random`, en canvi, extreu un "
"coeficient independent per a cada col·locació, de manera uniforme i "
"aleatòria dins de ``coefficient_range`` (``(-1.0, 1.0)`` per defecte):"

#: ../../modules/analog/analog_hamiltonian.rst:46
msgid ""
"Note that for both of these constructors, the terms are built for i < j, "
"such that building a 2-qubit Hamiltonian with the term ``XY`` will result"
" in ``X(0) Y(1)``, and not ``X(1) Y(0)``. If you want something more "
"symmetric, use ``XY`` and ``YX`` terms."
msgstr ""
"Tingueu en compte que, en tots dos constructors, els termes es construeixen "
"per a i < j, de manera que construir un Hamiltonià de 2 qubits amb el terme "
"``XY`` donarà com a resultat ``X(0) Y(1)``, i no ``X(1) Y(0)``. Si voleu "
"alguna cosa més simètrica, feu servir els termes ``XY`` i ``YX``."

